SageAttention Wheel Factory

This product applies downstream build-system modifications to SageAttention,
which is Copyright (c) 2024 SageAttention team and licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0.

SageAttention source is fetched from its upstream repository at build time and
is not vendored here. The exact source commit is recorded in matrix.json and in
every generated wheel manifest.

The downstream patch includes the one-line SM90 custom-op binding fix from
upstream SageAttention commit d9704247a5139ab4c03bf7fc6b35cc0e2cbb5ea4.
